Mochy iOS
=========

Mochy iOS is an iOS 12+ port of Mochy Music, written in Swift/UIKit.

Credits (please keep this file):

- Mochy Music by realidkroo (https://github.com/realidkroo/mochy-music), licensed GPL-3.0.
  This project reuses its ideas, its way of talking to YouTube Music and its client settings,
  rewritten for iOS. Say "ported from Mochy Music" wherever you share this app.
- Mochy Music is itself a fork of ViviMusic by vivizzz007Z and is built on Metrolist
  by Mostafa Alagamy. Those credits stay with it.
- Lyrics and metadata providers that Mochy talks to (used in later milestones): LRCLIB by
  tranxuanthang, SimpMusic by maxrave-dev, LyricsPlus by Ibra Al Tabian, Better Lyrics API by
  Boidushya, Monochrome Music, AutoEq. Each one belongs to its own authors.
- InnerTube wrapper ideas come from RiMusic / InnerTube by fast4x, as credited in Mochy Music.

